WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:08.500
Data Vault 2.0 delivers enterprise historical auditability
and resilient multi-source integration across complex feeds.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:18.200
Yet asking an LLM to emit Data Vault SQL directly risks
Alg A.5 hash collisions, Dual Zero Key bugs, and destructive UPDATEs.

3
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:27.850
Open-DV V2 pairs an Agent-first 7-Step Guided Workbench
with deterministic L1 codemods and V1–V8 CEGAR proofs.

4
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:39.500
Run uv run opendv serve for zero-auth loopback access on :8420
(non-loopback hosts fail closed without --allow-remote-unauthenticated).

5
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:51.500
Step 1 selects Blank Genesis, Starter Packs, or .opendv.zip;
Step 2 profiles 6 connectors with zero-LLM DocumentMap indexing.

6
00:00:51.500 --> 00:01:01.500
Step 3 previews 125-perm MinHash clusters, ConceptMemory Pin/Mute
tags, and explicit Steward Scan Consent per scanned PDF page.

7
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:15.500
Step 4 isolates /coord and /scout via JobMcpBroker alongside
the Budget Meter (Turns, Tokens, Active Seconds) and Hold cards.

8
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:28.500
Verify 4-Path grounding (PATH_A1, PATH_A2, PATH_B1, PATH_B2) in
the Citation Drawer before committing Graph A in Step 5 Explorer.

9
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:37.500
Edit keys and YAML CST cleanly across 4 modes in Step 5 with
OCC base_revision_id guards and Ask FIBO alignment receipts.

10
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:51.500
Step 6 Guided ⇄ Observatory pairs Steward Decision Cards with
L1 codemods, V1–V5 symbolic checks, and V6 15-invariant DuckDB proofs.

11
00:01:51.500 --> 00:02:04.850
V6B anti-patterns, V7 Semantic Critic, and V8 Horizon Critic
test BRK-01..08 breakages before sealing VaultSchemaIR v2.0.

12
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:18.500
Step 7 compiles VaultSchemaIR v2.0 into 11 targets (8 SQL dialects,
Iceberg, Parquet, dbt) with a sandboxed read-only DuckDB runner.

13
00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:31.850
Inspect 5-Zone Z0–Z4 lineage in 4-view DV Schema Explorer and replay
Last-Event-ID timelines, Attempts, and receipts in Run Explorer.

14
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:44.850
Script every workflow with the unified opendv CLI & 17-tool MCP:
project init, source attach, ontology fibo-qa, vault logs, storage query.
